{"evidence_id": "K01.P01", "doc_id": "K01", "title": "退货条件与明确确认", "content": "只有订单实际状态为 delivered（已送达）时，才能提交退货申请。pending、processed、cancelled 都不满足这个条件。用户说已经收到不能替代订单查询结果；应先查本人订单。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_paraphrase", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K01.P02", "doc_id": "K01", "title": "退货条件与明确确认", "content": "提交前需要确认具体订单、完整退货商品及数量、接收退款的方式。客服应先展示操作详情，得到明确同意后再提交。询问能否退货、提供订单号或表达不满，都不自动等于确认操作。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_paraphrase", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K01.P03", "doc_id": "K01", "title": "退货条件与明确确认", "content": "上游未规定退货申请的天数限制、运费承担、必须原包装或质量证明门槛。不能套用其他店铺规定，也不能因为资料没有规定就承诺无条件受理所有订单。应按已知状态和规则核实。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_paraphrase", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K02.P01", "doc_id": "K02", "title": "退款去向与已有礼品卡", "content": "退货申请的退款去向必须是原支付方式，或该用户已有的礼品卡。不能任意改到另一张信用卡、另一笔订单的支付方式，或他人的收款方式。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_paraphrase", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K02.P02", "doc_id": "K02", "title": "退款去向与已有礼品卡", "content": "礼品卡需要存在于当前用户的支付资料中。用户只说退到礼品卡但没有说明具体哪一张时，如存在多个候选，应澄清；不能自行创建礼品卡或猜测编号。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_paraphrase", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K02.P03", "doc_id": "K02", "title": "退款去向与已有礼品卡", "content": "原支付方式可能是信用卡、PayPal 或礼品卡。不能一概说 PayPal 不支持退货原路退款。是否可用取决于该笔订单的原支付记录和用户已有的礼品卡。退款去向合法也不表示款项已经到账。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_paraphrase", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K03.P01", "doc_id": "K03", "title": "退货申请状态与到账区别", "content": "工具成功会将订单改为 return requested（已申请退货），记录 return_items 和 return_payment_method_id。这表示申请已提交，不表示仓库已经收到商品、审核完成或银行款项到账。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/src/tau2/domains/retail/tools.py", "section": "return_delivered_order_items"}, {"url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K03.P02", "doc_id": "K03", "title": "退货申请状态与到账区别", "content": "固定版本的退货工具没有真实打款、发送邮件或生成寄回运单的功能。政策描述后续将收到邮件指引，但客服不能仅凭申请成功就声称邮件已发送或提供不存在的运单。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/src/tau2/domains/retail/tools.py", "section": "return_delivered_order_items"}, {"url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K03.P03", "doc_id": "K03", "title": "退货申请状态与到账区别", "content": "上游没有给出已送达商品退货退款的到账时间。不能承诺三天到账，也不能把取消订单章节中的五至七个工作日直接当作退货申请的时效。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/src/tau2/domains/retail/tools.py", "section": "return_delivered_order_items"}, {"url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K03.P04", "doc_id": "K03", "title": "退货申请状态与到账区别", "content": "申请后该订单已不再是 delivered，原退货工具不能再次提交同单退货。用户要补退其他商品或改去向时，应说明当前工具限制，必要时交接，不能承诺直接追加成功。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/src/tau2/domains/retail/tools.py", "section": "return_delivered_order_items"}, {"url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Return delivered order"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K04.P01", "doc_id": "K04", "title": "查找订单与区分商品编号", "content": "订单号用于定位一笔订单，示例格式为 #W0000000。product_id 指一类产品，item_id 指具体款式。两种编号不能互换；退货清单需要具体 item_id 及对应数量。示例编号不是真实订单。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Domain basic / Order / Product"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K04.P02", "doc_id": "K04", "title": "查找订单与区分商品编号", "content": "不记得订单号时，可在完成沙箱用户查找后，从该用户的订单中按商品和已有线索定位。若有多个匹配订单，应请用户澄清。该版本订单没有下单时间字段，不能只凭列表位置断言哪笔最新。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Domain basic / Order / Product"}, {"url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/db.json", "section": "Order/User fields; no date or ordering contract claimed"}, {"url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/src/tau2/domains/retail/data_model.py", "section": "Order/User fields; no date or ordering contract claimed"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K04.P03", "doc_id": "K04", "title": "查找订单与区分商品编号", "content": "订单记录中的 fulfillments 可提供已有 tracking_id 和对应商品。空记录不等于能够推算到货日，有物流号也不等于已有实时轨迹。资料不足时应说明无法确认。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "upstream_derived", "source_refs": [{"url": "https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench/blob/fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992/data/tau2/domains/retail/policy.md", "section": "Domain basic / Order / Product"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K05.P01", "doc_id": "K05", "title": "多订单申请准备与改口", "content": "准备退货时，请说明要退哪些订单中的哪些商品、数量和希望使用的合法退款方式。暂时没有编号可以先描述商品，再通过本人订单核实。不要为了准备材料而提供密码、验证码或与办理无关的资料。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K05", "section": "项目沙箱办理说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K05.P02", "doc_id": "K05", "title": "多订单申请准备与改口", "content": "多笔订单分别核实、逐单提交和逐单报告。对一笔订单的确认不自动覆盖另一笔。用户对已列明的多单完整详情一次明确确认时，可以按其确认范围逐单办理，但不能把未展示的商品加进去。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K05", "section": "项目沙箱办理说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K05.P03", "doc_id": "K05", "title": "多订单申请准备与改口", "content": "同一订单应在提交前收齐全部退货商品。用户在提交前改商品、数量或退款方式后，需要按新详情确认；提交后需要补退则应先查申请状态并说明工具限制。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K05", "section": "项目沙箱办理说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K05.P04", "doc_id": "K05", "title": "多订单申请准备与改口", "content": "单笔成功而另一笔失败时，分别说明各笔结果；已成功的申请不因另一笔失败自动撤销。确认失败原因之前，不反复提交已成功订单。上述说明是项目沙箱流程，不是新的退货资格。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K05", "section": "项目沙箱办理说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K06.P01", "doc_id": "K06", "title": "沙箱退货通知与人工交接", "content": "本项目的退货通知样例仅用于演示阅读，字段包括订单号、已申请的商品和数量、退款去向、申请状态。样例不是实际发送记录，展示样例不表示邮箱里已有邮件。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K06", "section": "项目自编通知阅读说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K06.P02", "doc_id": "K06", "title": "沙箱退货通知与人工交接", "content": "收到通知时可核对订单、商品数量和退款去向是否与确认内容一致。资料未给寄回地址、承运商或运费规则时，不自行猜测；等待经过核实的指引或向客服询问。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K06", "section": "项目自编通知阅读说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K06.P03", "doc_id": "K06", "title": "沙箱退货通知与人工交接", "content": "需要交接时，摘要应记录已核实的订单、用户目标、已完成与未完成事项、受限原因，不包含密码和验证码。沙箱交接工具返回成功不等于真实坐席接入或工单已经创建。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K06", "section": "项目自编通知阅读说明"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "all"}
{"evidence_id": "K07.P01", "doc_id": "K07", "title": "消费电子退货准备建议", "content": "平板、电子书或相机若保存个人资料，寄回前建议由用户自行核对需要保留的内容并做好备份；涉及账号或清除数据的具体操作应按准确机型说明确认。客服不索要密码、验证码、照片或完整备份。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K07", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "consumer_electronics"}
{"evidence_id": "K07.P02", "doc_id": "K07", "title": "消费电子退货准备建议", "content": "按购买清单核对设备、随附配件和数量，分别记录机身与配件，避免把另一个订单的部件混入。不要仅凭电子书和平板外形接近就把两者视为同一商品；实际退货仍需核对订单款式。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K07", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "consumer_electronics"}
{"evidence_id": "K07.P03", "doc_id": "K07", "title": "消费电子退货准备建议", "content": "这些是项目自编的寄回准备建议，不新增必须清除数据、配件齐全或保留原包装才能申请的条件。具体机型的恢复设置方法、承运要求和寄回地址不在本指南中，不能据此编造。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K07", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "consumer_electronics"}
{"evidence_id": "K08.P01", "doc_id": "K08", "title": "小家电退货准备建议", "content": "净化器、吸尘器和电水壶可先按订单清单记录主机及随附部件。吸尘器的吸头、集尘部件与净化器的滤芯用途不同，不应把同一张配件清单套到所有家电；不确定是否随附时先核实清单。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K08", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "small_appliances"}
{"evidence_id": "K08.P02", "doc_id": "K08", "title": "小家电退货准备建议", "content": "准备寄回时不要为了满足客服要求自行拆机或维修。涉及可拆部件、清洁和包装的具体要求，需依据准确机型或已核实的指引；本指南没有提供拆卸步骤或具体承运要求。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K08", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "small_appliances"}
{"evidence_id": "K08.P03", "doc_id": "K08", "title": "小家电退货准备建议", "content": "部件清点和准备建议不构成额外拒退门槛。缺少包装或无法确认某配件时，应记录情况并按已知业务规则核实，不自动声称不能退货，也不承诺清洁或维修后就一定获准。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K08", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "small_appliances"}
{"evidence_id": "K09.P01", "doc_id": "K09", "title": "服饰鞋类退货准备建议", "content": "T恤和徒步靴寄回前，可将颜色、尺码与订单款式逐项核对；多件同款要核对实际数量，成双鞋类应记录左右配对，避免退错另一订单中外观相似的商品。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K09", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "apparel_footwear"}
{"evidence_id": "K09.P02", "doc_id": "K09", "title": "服饰鞋类退货准备建议", "content": "可将需要寄回与准备保留的商品分开放置，并按订单整理清单。吊牌、原包装或使用痕迹的具体受理规则，上游政策没有规定，本指南不新增这些要求。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K09", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "apparel_footwear"}
{"evidence_id": "K09.P03", "doc_id": "K09", "title": "服饰鞋类退货准备建议", "content": "这类准备建议不授权换码、换色或换货。如果用户想换一个尺码，客服应说明当前办理范围；不能擅自把换货请求执行成退货，也不能承诺退款后一定能买到目标款式。", "language": "zh", "source_kind": "project_authored", "source_refs": [{"project_document": "K09", "section": "项目沙箱准备建议，非资格条件"}], "policy_release": "v1.0.1", "policy_commit": "fc0055dc4e0a316c3f83133267fbd6faaa770992", "scope": "project_zh", "category": "apparel_footwear"}
